Spec: Localization

Purpose:
  English and German UI copy from ARB files.

Owns:
  ./app_en.arb
  ./app_de.arb
  ./app_localizations.dart
  ./app_localizations_en.dart
  ./app_localizations_de.dart
  ./glossary_de.md

Must:
  English is the default and reads naturally; German follows `./glossary_de.md`.
  Every key exists in both ARB files.
  Counts use ICU plurals; the home greetings are the `skaterGreeting1` … keys, collected by @skaterGreetings.
  A system language without app copy falls back to English.
  Generated `app_localizations*.dart` files come from `flutter gen-l10n`.
